---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Stories of Impact | Iowa CYP Families
description: Real stories from Iowa National Guard children, teens, and caregivers who found connection and resilience through Iowa CYP.
permalink: /stories/index.html
---
{% set storyQuoteIds = ['Q006', 'Q007', 'Q008', 'Q009', 'Q010', 'Q011', 'Q012', 'Q013', 'Q014', 'Q015', 'Q016', 'Q017'] %}
{% set voiceQuotes = quotes.items | selectattr('id', 'in', storyQuoteIds) | list %}
{% set storiesHeroPhoto = requestPhoto({
  id: "stories-hero",
  context: page.url ~ "#hero",
  note: "Stories hero background"
}) %}

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden" data-reveal>
  <img
    src="{{ storiesHeroPhoto.src }}"
    alt="{{ storiesHeroPhoto.alt }}"
    class="w-full h-[260px] md:h-[360px] object-cover"
    loading="lazy"
    decoding="async"
  >
</section>

{% set storiesImage = storiesHeroPhoto.src %}
{% if storiesImage and storiesImage[0] == '/' %}
  {% set storiesImage = site.domain ~ storiesImage %}
{% endif %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": "{{ title }}",
  "url": "{{ site.domain }}{{ page.url }}",
  {% if storiesImage %}"image": "{{ storiesImage }}",{% endif %}
  "description": "{{ description | escape }}"
}
</script>

<nav class="sticky top-20 z-30 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border-y border-slate-200" aria-label="Section navigation" data-reveal>
  <div class="container flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">
    <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-primary/10 transition" href="#spotlight">
      <span>Spotlight</span>
    </a>
    <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-primary/10 transition" href="#family-stories">
      <span>Family Stories</span>
    </a>
    <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-primary/10 transition" href="#mission-video">
      <span>Mission Video</span>
    </a>
    <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-primary/10 transition" href="#voices">
      <span>Voices</span>
    </a>
    <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-primary/10 transition" href="#share-story">
      <span>Share Yours</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section id="spotlight" class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-24" data-reveal>
  <div class="container grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_0.95fr] lg:items-center">
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-secondary">Community spotlight</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-white">News story: Community lifts families during deployment</h2>
      <p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Program Director Chris Cox sat down with local news to share how partners step in when Guard families face deployments. The feature highlights a free horse camp hosted by Jester Park Equestrian Center that gave military youth room to breathe, laugh, and stay connected while a parent was away.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-white/80">
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Why it mattered:</span> Volunteers, donors, and Jester Park covered every cost so Guard kids could simply show up.</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">What families said:</span> Time with the horses eased anxiety and sparked conversations about deployment in a safe setting.</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">How to use it:</span> Share this clip with civic groups and potential sponsors who want real examples of community impact.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <article class="content-card bg-white/5 border-white/20 backdrop-blur text-white space-y-4">
      <div class="aspect-video rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-white/30">
        <video controls preload="metadata" poster="/assets/img/stories/news_story.png" class="w-full h-full" playsinline>
          <source src="/assets/video/news_interview.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          Your browser does not support the video tag.
        </video>
      </div>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">Full interview: Chris Cox explains how community partners like Jester Park Equestrian Center rally around Guard families to keep kids grounded during deployment.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="family-stories" class="bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-white to-primary/10 py-24" data-reveal>
  <div class="container grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_0.95fr] lg:items-center">
    <article class="content-card shadow-lg space-y-5 h-full order-last lg:order-first">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-primary/70">Parent perspective</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Finding friendship after a cross-country move</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">When one Guard family relocated from Texas to Iowa, their daughter wondered who would understand what military life felt like. In this short clip, her mom shares how a familiar face from an Iowa CYP program turned into instant camaraderie—and how that connection steadied their whole household.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Shared experience:</span> A fellow military youth spotted her at camp and reminded her she wasn’t starting over alone.</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Ripple effect:</span> Confidence followed her home, making the new duty station feel less overwhelming.</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Takeaway:</span> CYP friendships can outlast moves and mobilizations, giving kids anchors no matter the zip code.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <div class="content-card shadow-lg h-full space-y-4">
      <div class="aspect-video rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/rZL1KANrLt4"
          title="Guard parent testimonial"
          class="w-full h-full"
          loading="lazy"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Use this testimony when talking with school counselors, partner organizations, or potential sponsors who want to understand the on-the-ground impact of CYP relationships.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="mission-video" class="bg-white py-24" data-reveal>
  <div class="container grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] items-start">
    <article class="content-card bg-slate-900 text-white border-slate-900 space-y-4 h-full shadow-lg" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">See the program in action</h2>
      {% if site.links.programOverviewVideo %}
        {% set embedUrl = site.links.programOverviewVideo | replace('https://youtu.be/', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/') %}
        <div class="aspect-video rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/20">
          <iframe src="{{ embedUrl }}" title="Iowa CYP Overview" class="w-full h-full" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
      {% else %}
        <video class="w-full rounded-xl" controls poster="/assets/img/stories/news_story.png" playsinline>
          <source src="/assets/video/news_interview.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          Sorry, your browser does not support embedded video.
        </video>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="text-white/80 text-sm">Share this overview with partners and community members to invite new champions into the work.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="content-card shadow-lg space-y-4 h-full">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Mission in Motion</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">{{ info.mission }}</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2">
        {% for pillar in info.strategicInfrastructure %}
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">{{ pillar.title }}:</span> {{ pillar.description }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="voices" class="bg-primary/5 py-16" data-reveal>
  <div class="container space-y-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-primary/70">Voices you can trust</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Why consistent support matters statewide</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Parents, teens, youth, and caregivers keep us honest. These quotes highlight what sticks with them long after an event or program ends.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="quote-carousel" data-quote-carousel>
      <div class="content-card quote-carousel__slides" role="region" aria-live="polite">
        {% for quote in voiceQuotes %}
          {% set attribution = quote.role or quote.author %}
          <figure class="quote-slide {% if loop.first %}is-active{% endif %}" data-quote-slide>
            <blockquote class="text-primary text-lg italic leading-relaxed">&ldquo;{{ quote.text }}&rdquo;</blockquote>
            {% if attribution %}
              <figcaption class="mt-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">{{ attribution }}</figcaption>
            {% endif %}
          </figure>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="quote-carousel__controls" aria-label="Quote navigation">
        <button type="button" class="quote-nav-btn" data-quote-prev aria-label="Previous quote">
          <span aria-hidden="true">&larr;</span>
        </button>
        <div class="quote-carousel__dots" role="tablist">
          {% for quote in voiceQuotes %}
            <button
              type="button"
              class="quote-dot {% if loop.first %}is-active{% endif %}"
              data-quote-dot="{{ loop.index0 }}"
              aria-label="Show quote {{ loop.index }}"
              role="tab"
              {% if loop.first %}aria-selected="true"{% else %}aria-selected="false"{% endif %}
            >
              <span class="sr-only">Quote {{ loop.index }}</span>
            </button>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="quote-nav-btn" data-quote-next aria-label="Next quote">
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="share-story" class="bg-white py-24" data-reveal>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content-card border border-primary/20 shadow-lg md:p-12 space-y-5">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Share your Iowa CYP story</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700">We feature fresh voices each season. Send a quick note or ask for a call—photos welcome! We’ll coordinate next steps together.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your story is what keeps lawmakers, sponsors, and community partners investing in these programs. When you share what mattered, we can keep showing up for every Guard-connected kid.</p>
      <a class="btn-secondary inline-flex items-center gap-2" href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}?subject=Share%20My%20Iowa%20CYP%20Story">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path d="M20 4H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12c0 1.103.897 2 2 2h16c1.103 0 2-.897 2-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2zm0 2v.01L12 13 4 6.01V6h16zM4 18v-9.764l7.382 5.768a1 1 0 001.236 0L20 8.236V18H4z" fill="currentColor"/>
        </svg>
        <span>Email the team</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
